  "brief": "THE CASE IN FIVE LINES\n1. Bryce Corbin, 50, night inventory supervisor at Northstar Blast Freezer & Logistics, was found unresponsive in the insulated manifest office on 2017-10-12; manner is homicide from blunt force craniocerebral trauma (doc01, doc02).\n2. Medical Examiner set the wide window at 22:36–00:36 (doc02), while Bryce Corbin's 23:52 outgoing SMS (doc10) and 23:59 PIN 3854 unlock (doc05) narrow the survival floor to 23:59–00:36.\n3. Miles Wilkins gave a false Year-1 alibi (doc07) refuted by 23:02–23:24 ALPR crossings (doc09), but his 23:24 northbound exit and 23:42 cardlock swipe 16.2 miles away precede Bryce Corbin's 23:52 SMS, corroborating his absence during the narrowed window.\n4. Lonnie Okafor's departure account shows medium 7-year drift (doc12 vs. doc13), and the press rumor regarding the defective latch is neutralized by 2016 public inspection docket doc16.\n5. Master PIN 9050 (assigned to Kirk Guzman) unlocked the insulated manifest office at 00:13 (doc05) and circuit load ran until 00:25 (doc11), while CSI notes a 2-vs-1 marker 5 discrepancy, an uncollected 23:45 photo, and an unpulled exterior camera.\n\nSTRONGEST CONTRADICTION\nKirk Guzman's denial of unlocking or entering the insulated manifest office conflicts with the keypad export:\n- doc03: \"I never entered the insulated manifest office at any point that night. On my rounds I only check the exterior handle from the corridor.\"\n- doc05: \"2017-10-12 00:13 — PIN 9050 UNLOCK\" (paired with doc05 PIN schedule assigning 9050 to Kirk Guzman, and doc11 load drop at 00:25).\n\nALIBI TABLE (Narrowed survival window 23:59–00:36 (within ME window 22:36–00:36))\n- Kirk Guzman: CONTRADICTED\n- Miles Wilkins: CORROBORATED (cleared of narrowed window by doc09 + doc10)\n- Lonnie Okafor: UNCORROBORATED (MEDIUM multi-year drift, doc12 vs. doc13)\n- Colleen Mercado: UNCORROBORATED (22:54 entry confirmed by doc05; no exit log)\n\nTOP THREE LEADS\n1. (80 pts, 40 + 25 + 15 = 80) Have the detective re-interview Kirk Guzman in person and ask why master PIN 9050 unlocked the insulated manifest office strike at 00:13 (doc05) while doc03 denies entering and doc04 logs only a corridor handle check.\n2. (80 pts, 40 + 25 + 15 = 80) Have the detective re-interview Kirk Guzman in person regarding the high-severity contradiction between his 23:00 dark-office claim (doc03) and the AMI sub-meter load continuing until 00:25 (doc11).\n3. (60 pts, 25 + 20 + 15 = 60) Submit preserved biological trace swab Item 3 from Property Clerk ledger doc15 to the state forensic laboratory for STR and touch-DNA testing.\n\nGAP LIST\n- Marker 5 count discrepancy: two cut numbered polypropylene pallet seals observed in scene report but only one booked in Property Clerk ledger.\n- Original digital file and EXIF metadata for the 23:45 patron photograph were never collected or booked.\n- Exterior municipal/commercial camera facing the property was never pulled.\n- Preserved biological swab Item 3 remains sealed and untested for STR/touch DNA.\n\nThis board judges the file. The detective does the detecting."
