  "brief": "THE CASE IN FIVE LINES\n1. Lucia Burnett, 43, night inventory supervisor at Glacier Bay Cold Storage, was found unresponsive in the insulated manifest office on 2015-11-13; manner is homicide from blunt force craniocerebral trauma (doc01, doc02).\n2. Medical Examiner set the wide window at 22:32–00:32 (doc02), while Lucia Burnett's 23:48 outgoing SMS (doc10) and 23:55 PIN 3224 unlock (doc05) narrow the survival floor to 23:55–00:32.\n3. Priya Kline gave a false Year-1 alibi (doc07) refuted by 22:58–23:20 ALPR crossings (doc09), but his 23:20 northbound exit and 23:38 cardlock swipe 16.2 miles away precede Lucia Burnett's 23:48 SMS, corroborating his absence during the narrowed window.\n4. Gavin Sorensen's departure account shows medium 6-year drift (doc12 vs. doc13), and the press rumor regarding the defective latch is neutralized by 2015 public inspection docket doc16.\n5. Master PIN 9053 (assigned to Janet Ingram) unlocked the insulated manifest office at 00:09 (doc05) and circuit load ran until 00:21 (doc11), while CSI notes a 2-vs-1 marker 5 discrepancy, an uncollected 23:41 photo, and an unpulled exterior camera.\n\nSTRONGEST CONTRADICTION\nJanet Ingram's denial of unlocking or entering the insulated manifest office conflicts with the keypad export:\n- doc03: \"I never entered the insulated manifest office at any point that night. On my rounds I only check the exterior handle from the corridor.\"\n- doc05: \"2015-11-13 00:09 — PIN 9053 UNLOCK\" (paired with doc05 PIN schedule assigning 9053 to Janet Ingram, and doc11 load drop at 00:21).\n\nALIBI TABLE (Narrowed survival window 23:55–00:32 (within ME window 22:32–00:32))\n- Janet Ingram: CONTRADICTED\n- Priya Kline: CORROBORATED (cleared of narrowed window by doc09 + doc10)\n- Gavin Sorensen: UNCORROBORATED (MEDIUM multi-year drift, doc12 vs. doc13)\n- Ruben Keane: UNCORROBORATED (22:50 entry confirmed by doc05; no exit log)\n\nTOP THREE LEADS\n1. (80 pts, 40 + 25 + 15 = 80) Have the detective re-interview Janet Ingram in person and ask why master PIN 9053 unlocked the insulated manifest office strike at 00:09 (doc05) while doc03 denies entering and doc04 logs only a corridor handle check.\n2. (80 pts, 40 + 25 + 15 = 80) Have the detective re-interview Janet Ingram in person regarding the high-severity contradiction between his 23:00 dark-office claim (doc03) and the AMI sub-meter load continuing until 00:21 (doc11).\n3. (60 pts, 25 + 20 + 15 = 60) Submit preserved biological trace swab Item 3 from Property Clerk ledger doc15 to the state forensic laboratory for STR and touch-DNA testing.\n\nGAP LIST\n- Marker 5 count discrepancy: two cut numbered polypropylene pallet seals observed in scene report but only one booked in Property Clerk ledger.\n- Original digital file and EXIF metadata for the 23:41 patron photograph were never collected or booked.\n- Exterior municipal/commercial camera facing the property was never pulled.\n- Preserved biological swab Item 3 remains sealed and untested for STR/touch DNA.\n\nThis board judges the file. The detective does the detecting."
