w Gloria Moreau in person and ask why master PIN 9083 unlocked the dispatch cage office strike at 00:11 (doc05) while doc03 denies entering and doc04 logs only a corridor handle check.\n2. (80 pts, 40 + 25 + 15 = 80) Have the detective re-interview Gloria Moreau in person regarding the high-severity contradiction between his 23:00 dark-office claim (doc03) and the AMI sub-meter load continuing until 00:23 (doc11).\n3. (60 pts, 25 + 20 + 15 = 60) Submit preserved biological trace swab Item 3 from Property Clerk ledger doc15 to the state forensic laboratory for STR and touch-DNA testing.\n\nGAP LIST\n- Marker 5 count discrepancy: two clipped high-security trailer bolt seals observed in scene report but only one booked in Property Clerk ledger.\n- Original digital file and EXIF metadata for the 23:43 patron photograph were never collected or booked.\n- Exterior municipal/commercial camera facing the property was never pulled.\n- Preserved biological swab Item 3 remains sealed and untested for STR/touch DNA.\n\nThis board judges the file. The detective does the detecting."
