  "brief": "THE CASE IN FIVE LINES\n1. Veronica Hargrove, 50, graveyard dispatch supervisor at Corridor Express Freight Depot, was found unresponsive in the dispatch cage office on 2019-05-06; manner is homicide from blunt force craniocerebral trauma (doc01, doc02).\n2. Medical Examiner set the wide window at 22:34–00:34 (doc02), while Veronica Hargrove's 23:50 outgoing SMS (doc10) and 23:57 PIN 2794 unlock (doc05) narrow the survival floor to 23:57–00:34.\n3. Bianca Castellano gave a false Year-1 alibi (doc07) refuted by 23:00–23:22 ALPR crossings (doc09), but his 23:22 northbound exit and 23:40 cardlock swipe 16.2 miles away precede Veronica Hargrove's 23:50 SMS, corroborating his absence during the narrowed window.\n4. Keith Kaczmarek's departure account shows medium 7-year drift (doc12 vs. doc13), and the press rumor regarding the defective latch is neutralized by 2018 public inspection docket doc16.\n5. Master PIN 9066 (assigned to Selena Pelletier) unlocked the dispatch cage office at 00:11 (doc05) and circuit load ran until 00:23 (doc11), while CSI notes a 2-vs-1 marker 5 discrepancy, an uncollected 23:43 photo, and an unpulled exterior camera.\n\nSTRONGEST CONTRADICTION\nSelena Pelletier's denial of unlocking or entering the dispatch cage office conflicts with the keypad export:\n- doc03: \"I never entered the dispatch cage office at any point that night. On my rounds I only check the exterior handle from the corridor.\"\n- doc05: \"2019-05-06 00:11 — PIN 9066 UNLOCK\" (paired with doc05 PIN schedule assigning 9066 to Selena Pelletier, and doc11 load drop at 00:23).\n\nALIBI TABLE (Narrowed survival window 23:57–00:34 (within ME window 22:34–00:34))\n- Selena Pelletier: CONTRADICTED\n- Bianca Castellano: CORROBORATED (cleared of narrowed window by doc09 + doc10)\n- Keith Kaczmarek: UNCORROBORATED (MEDIUM multi-year drift, doc12 vs. doc13)\n- Bianca Kaczmarek: UNCORROBORATED (22:52 entry confirmed by doc05; no exit log)\n\nTOP THREE LEADS\n1. (80 pts, 40 + 25 + 15 = 80) Have the detective re-interview Selena Pelletier in person and ask why master PIN 9066 unlocked the dispatch cage office strike at 00:11 (doc05) while doc03 denies entering and doc04 logs only a corridor handle check.\n2. (80 pts, 40 + 25 + 15 = 80) Have the detective re-interview Selena Pelletier in person regarding the high-severity contradiction between his 23:00 dark-office claim (doc03) and the AMI sub-meter load continuing until 00:23 (doc11).\n3. (60 pts, 25 + 20 + 15 = 60) Submit preserved biological trace swab Item 3 from Property Clerk ledger doc15 to the state forensic laboratory for STR and touch-DNA testing.\n\nGAP LIST\n- Marker 5 count discrepancy: two clipped high-security trailer bolt seals observed in scene report but only one booked in Property Clerk ledger.\n- Original digital file and EXIF metadata for the 23:43 patron photograph were never collected or booked.\n- Exterior municipal/commercial camera facing the property was never pulled.\n- Preserved biological swab Item 3 remains sealed and untested for STR/touch DNA.\n\nThis board judges the file. The detective does the detecting."
